cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DAE Coverage Floor Flatness: Autonomous Floor Flatness Measurement via Design-File-Driven Coverage Path Planning"
abstract: >-
  A ROS 2 pipeline that converts a building's 3D design file (.dae/BIM) into a
  2D map, decomposes the interior into room-level nodes, plans an offline
  coverage path with TSP, Fields2Cover and A*, drives it autonomously with
  Nav2/AMCL, and produces a millimetre-scale floor flatness heatmap from a
  mobile 3D LiDAR.
type: software
